# Git Commits

- Commit only when explicitly asked. Finishing a change, passing tests, or
  reaching a milestone is not a reason to commit on your own.
- When committing to the main branch, do not ask for confirmation. Proceed directly.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, or any other Cursor attribution trailer to commits or PRs.
